    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>&quot;Computation graphs are made up of a DAG of nodes, which represent what is &quot; &quot;commonly called a &apos;layer&apos; or &apos;pipeline stage&apos; in machine learning frameworks. &quot; &quot;For example, it can be a node of type &apos;Conv&apos; that takes in an image, a filter &quot; &quot;tensor and a bias tensor, and produces the convolved output.&quot; <linebreak/>
 </para>
    </detaileddescription>
